{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"c195d6c5-ce6e-44c6-92b4-d978b4efe5ec","title":"Canada Prize Track","slug":"worlds-fair-canada","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout the Prize \u0026amp; Scope\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eCrypto World’s Fair\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e \u003c/u\u003eis the latest edition of crypto’s largest online startup competition, brought to you by \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eColosseum\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e! Previous editions of Solana’s hackathons have been the birthplace of legendary projects such as Tapedrive, Tensor, StepN, and Dialect.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis side track is run by \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.superteam.ca/\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(99, 102, 241);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSuperteam Canada\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e. Teams competing for the global hackathon \u003cu\u003ewho registered with Canada 🇨🇦\u0026nbsp; as their primary location\u003c/u\u003e may apply. \u003cem\u003eSee “Submission Requirements” below for details on eligibility.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDetails:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis listing is a side track, meaning it is exclusive of\u003c/span\u003e prizes from Colosseum for the global hackathon\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e. This means, as a team based in Canada, your chances of winning a prize are much higher - even if you don't win at the global level, you still have a shot at winning something on the national level!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRewards\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e🥇 First Prize: $2,500 USDC\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e🥈 Second Prize: $1,500 USDC\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e🥉 Third Prize: $1,000 USDC\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJudging Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003eThe judging criteria for this track will mirror that of the global hackathon. This means the following criteria will be considered: product functionality, potential impact, novelty, UX, whether or not open-sourced, and business plan. Judging criteria for the Cypherpunk Hackathon can be found in the\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.colosseum.org/hackathon#faqs\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(99, 102, 241);\"\u003e \u003cu\u003eColosseum Hackathon FAQs\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSubmission Requirements\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003eYou must register for the hackathon on the\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://arena.colosseum.org/signup\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(99, 102, 241);\"\u003e \u003cu\u003eColosseum Platform\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e and mark “CANADA” as your team’s primary country.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003eYour project must be eligible as per the official rules of the World’s Fair competition and your team must abide by the\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.colosseum.org/code-of-ethics\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(99, 102, 241);\"\u003e \u003cu\u003eColosseum Code of Ethics\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResources\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eCrypto World’s Fair Site\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.superteam.ca/colosseum\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSuperteam Canada Resources\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://hackathon.superteam.fun/\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSuperteam Hackathon Resources\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c